      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p8-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "で、着物って……いくらするんすか？",
          "en": "So, uh... how much does a kimono cost?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "絹の訪問着なら、仕立てまで入れて数十万円",
          "en": "A silk visiting kimono, tailored, runs hundreds of thousands of yen.",
          "note": "A homongi (\"visiting kimono\") is a semi-formal silk kimono worn to weddings, ceremonies and parties."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "す、数十万!?",
          "en": "H-hundreds of thousands!?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "でも、着る人は減りました。売り上げは、一番多かった頃の十分の一ほど",
          "en": "But fewer people wear them. Sales are a tenth of what they were at the peak."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "呉服の小売市場　1981年 約1兆8000億円 → 2025年 2030億円（矢野経済研究所）",
          "en": "Kimono retail market: 1981 approx. 1.8 trillion yen -> 2025: 203 billion yen (Yano Research Institute)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "どこのお家のタンスにも、着ない着物が眠っています",
          "en": "Every home has unworn kimono asleep in a chest."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……うちの実家にも、ある",
          "en": "...My parents' place has some."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "でも観光地の着物レンタルは、一日三千円から八千円で行列です",
          "en": "But tourist rentals cost 3,000-8,000 yen a day, with lines!"
        }
      ]
    },
