          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……右前、忘れないで",
          "en": "...Don't forget right-front."
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ドライコースは、ドライクリーニングと同じ!!",
          "en": "The dry cycle is the same as dry cleaning!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-2-2",
